OL,3,GNEWSAStreet cordoned off after stabbing
OL,4,Ain city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been taken to hospital and a
OL,7,Fstreet in Nottingham city centre has
OL,8,Fbeen taped off after a stabbing.
OL,10,FPolice said emergency services were
OL,11,Fcalled to Canal Street at 16:53 BST on
OL,12,FFriday after it received reports a man
OL,13,Fhad been stabbed.
OL,15,FThe force said the man had been taken
OL,16,Fto hospital with injuries which were
OL,17,Fnot believed to be life-threatening in
OL,18,Fnature.
OL,20,FOfficers have appealed for any
OL,21,Fwitnesses to contact the force.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
